Assess 测


  A short diagnostic: for each skill it starts at HSK3, moves up a level
  after 2 of 3 right and down otherwise, and finds where you are.
  Results replace the assessment table in wiki/overview.md.

  Character recognition    HSK3–4
  Vocabulary (passive)     not enough cards
  Grammar                  not enough cards
  Reading comprehension    not enough cards

  m  Mock test 模拟考: a timed HSK4 or HSK5 paper, about 15 minutes.


